OL,3,GNEWSAFC Isle of Man launches women's
OL,4,Afootball team
OL,5,
OL,6,FFC Isle of Man is launching a women's
OL,7,Ffootball team, with open training and
OL,8,Ftrial sessions due to start next month.
OL,10,FThe club will hold the sessions at
OL,11,FColby AFC on Tuesday 10 November from
OL,12,F20:00 to 21:30.
OL,14,FThe team plans to play six friendly
OL,15,Fmatches to begin with, before a
OL,16,Fpossible move into league football
OL,17,Fsubject to approval.
OL,19,FChairman David Pope said it was
OL,20,Fsomething the club "has wanted to
OL,21,Fachieve for some time".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
